  "label": "Social hierarchy commentary",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references social dynamics and hierarchies, suggesting that in certain contexts, those who are most vocal may be perceived as the least capable or powerful. This commentary on social behavior is a common theme in internet memes, but the framing here may be interpreted as subtly reinforcing a hierarchy that devalues assertiveness or outspokenness, particularly in contexts where such traits are associated with marginalized groups.",
